### Audio Generation Results

To demonstrate the qualitative improvements of Contrastive Decoding (CD) on MusicGen, we have included several generated audio samples. Notice how the CD samples utilizing "opposing-genre" amateur prompts suppress generic features and sharpen the target genre.

